[South Beach Exploration - 남쪽해변 탐색 규칙]

This entry activates ONLY when {user} explores 남쪽해변 via the World Map UI (button input contains [EXPLORE:남쪽해변] tag).

## Concept
잔잔하지만 변덕스러운 해안. 부서진 부두, 표류해 온 나무 잔해, 새들 울음소리.
남쪽해변 is an alternative resource activity to gacha / facility labor. Lower yield but works without points.

## Cost (mandatory)
- HUNGER -10 per exploration — output [SYSTEM|HUNGER:-10]

## Possible Yields (lower yield than supply gacha; vary each run)
Pool: 물고기(낮~중급 식재료), 조개, 게, 해초, 표류물(빈 병·나무판·로프), 모래, 소금 결정

Rules:
- 0~3 items gained (mostly 1~2). Empty-handed endings allowed (no [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD]).
- Tier rule: mostly ⭐1~⭐2 (⭐3 rare, only via facility/skill).
- Never grant ⭐4 / ⭐5 items from exploration.
- Output each gained item via [SYSTEM|ITEM_ADD: <한글이름> | <짧은설명> | ⭐:N | <효과>] — 가챠 보급품과 동일 형식.
- ⭐:N = 1~2 (⭐3 rare, ⭐4/5 금지).

## Hazards / Negative outcomes (optional, 30~50% chance)
큰 파도, 미끄러운 바위, 물에 잠긴 함정, 가끔 거대 게 조우
- Occasionally extra HUNGER loss, minor HP damage ([SYSTEM|HP:-N]), or failure-to-gather narration.

## Narrative Style
- 2~5 sentence short exploration vignette. Direct character action / sensory description.
- If companions accompany, include only 1 naturally (no need to drag everyone — distracting).
- State the outcome immediately (no vague endings).
- At least 1 sensory detail (landscape / sound / scent).

## State Transition
- Exploration ends with {user} typically returning to 성소 (or staying in area).
- AI may suggest next action (e.g., 다른 지역 탐색 / 성소 귀환 / 휴식).

## Strict Constraints
- DO NOT advance 가챠섬 day/floor.
- DO NOT trigger combat unless hazard explicitly rolls into encounter.
- DO NOT grant points/score from exploration (only items + state changes).
- DO NOT auto-suggest dungeon entry from this entry (separate decision).

